Package: graft
Title: Reviewable Knowledge from R Workflows
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("James", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "github@jameshwade.com")
Description: Builds a local knowledge store from related tables produced by R
    workflows. A data-dict or LinkML contract defines stable identities,
    fields, and references. Proposed changes are validated and reviewed before
    an atomic commit records their provenance and immutable revision history.
    Current records, bounded queries, and a managed Open Knowledge Format
    working tree are derived from the accepted revisions.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
